{"type":"standard","title":"Dane-zaa language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Dane-zaa language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q20826","titles":{"canonical":"Dane-zaa_language","normalized":"Dane-zaa language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Dane-zaa language</span></span>"},"pageid":31882449,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1351068797","tid":"687a6e3b-40dd-11f1-8e03-48f48e4e3c0f","timestamp":"2026-04-25T19:31:51Z","description":"Athabaskan language of western Canada","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dane-zaa_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dane-zaa_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dane-zaa_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Dane-zaa_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dane-zaa_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Dane-zaa_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dane-zaa_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Dane-zaa_language"}},"extract":"Dane-zaa, known in the language as Dane-ẕaa Ẕáágéʔ, formerly known as Beaver, is an Athabascan language of western Canada. It means \"people-regular language.\" About one-tenth of the Dane-zaa people speak the language.","extract_html":"<p><b>Dane-zaa</b>, known in the language as <b><span><i lang=\"bea\">Dane-ẕaa Ẕáágéʔ</i></span></b>, formerly known as <b>Beaver</b>, is an Athabascan language of western Canada. It means \"people-regular language.\" About one-tenth of the Dane-zaa people speak the language.</p>"}